.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLIFISTORE_DEMO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glifistore_demo
.Nd GlifiStore topology bootstrap sample
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints a short architecture bootstrap report: Segment size, detected CPU
topology, and the Worker count selected by the default policy.
It is a sample/diagnostic binary for version
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@ ,
not an operator maintenance tool and not a network client.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Always 0 on successful print.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glifistore 7 ,
.Xr glifistored 8
.Sh AUTHORS
GlifiStore contributors.
